  "attribution": "Port of Los Angeles Wharfinger Division vessel-activity summaries; Port of Los Angeles container statistics; U.S. EIA; U.S. EPA.",
  "scope_note": "Offline public-data benchmark. Vessel counts and dwell are official daily port statistics; non-reporting calendar days are explicitly interpolated. Hourly TEU remains a disclosed allocation, and energy values are regional/model inputs rather than terminal telemetry.",
